{"id":308,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"コース制で進路と個性を伸ばす明光学園","feature_description":"明光学園中学校・高等学校は、特色ある5つのコースを設け、進路に応じた学びを選べる学校です。探究や英語、表現に関わる学びを通して、思考力、判断力、表現力を育てる方針が見えます。中高一貫の流れの中で、個性を生かしながら進路を段階的に形にしやすい構成です。公式サイトの学校案内や教育ページが整理され、学びの方針と学校生活の両面を確認しやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":6188,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6189,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6190,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6191,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6192,"name":"テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6193,"name":"オーケストラ部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6194,"name":"合唱部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6195,"name":"ボランティア部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6196,"name":"放送部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6197,"name":"演劇部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6198,"name":"書道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6199,"name":"茶道部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/introduction/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":6200,"name":"クワイアチャイム部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://welcome.meiko.ed.jp/intro